				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				859,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Replay Sky events on listener registration to fix empty sidebar\n\nSkyBridge calls this after installing every `sky://*` Tauri listener because Mountain → Sky `app.emit()` events are NOT buffered — any emit fired before the listener was installed is silently dropped.\n\nIn the bundled-electron profile, extension activation (which triggers `register_scm_provider` and `$tree:register` notifications through Cocoon) starts ~580 log lines before the Sky bundle finishes booting (~1995 lines). Without this replay, all tree-view + SCM register events are lost and the Activity Bar / sidebar comes up empty even though state-side everything registered correctly.\n\nThe new `sky:replay-events` handler iterates through active TreeViews and SCM providers in application state, re-emitting the `sky://tree-view/create` and `sky://scm/register` events that were previously dropped. This restores the sidebar contents on boot.",
			"SHA": "1599d766f64f50d04aa4b0d73cb193243bbc43b2"
		},
